  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KH SILAKA - LoveIsDiversity of LBTIQ Wom</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to enhance and raise awareness on SOGIESC specifically on Cambodian Lesbian Bi-sexual and Transgender (LBT) issues/community. Its intend to enhance, raise awareness and advocacy activities through media platforms such as storytelling, podcast video, Facebook Live, online campaign, online sharing session on SOGIESC and LGBTIQ+ and radio talk show as well. Another main activity is to create a space for LBT+ women for counselling, mental health support, building networks and their capacities. Last but not least, the internal capacity development core members of Love Is Diversity team through training/sharing sessions in monthly meeting and learning by doing through implementing this project. This 12 months project is mostly focus on onlineactivities which is plannedto create more online dialogue about SOGIESC and LGBTIQ issues/community, produce more advocacy materials, and reach out directly to LGBTIQ audience and outside LGBTIQ community as well. Art competition, storytelling video, podcast series video about SOGIESC/LGBTIQ+, Facebook Live show, Monthly Quiz and Radio programme are the key main activities that is planned under this project.</narrative>
  </description>
